  "title": "Prospect Capital Completes $26 Million Investment in Security Fire Systems",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, May 4, 2026 – Prospect Capital Corporation (NASDAQ: PSEC) (“Prospect”) and an affiliate have provided a first lien senior secured term loan and a preferred equity investment in Security Fire Systems (“SFS”), aggregating approximately $26 million, in collaboration with Blackford Capital. Founded in 1993, SFS is an industry leader for fire security and […]",
